Output docs/previews/tui-overview.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Padding 8
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD/target/release:$PATH && clear"
Enter
Type "droidkraft-tui --graphics halfblocks"
Enter
Show
Sleep 9s
Type "1"
Sleep 3s
Type "t"
Sleep 2s
Type "t"
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
